      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude Guard]\nWelcome to Izlude.",
      "translation" : "[依斯魯得衛兵]\n歡迎來到依斯魯得島。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "F_IzludeChannel",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Channel Warp Official]\nIzlude is a verly lively place is it not?\nI am here to help make Izlude feel more smooth!\nI can send you to another copy of Izlude.\nDo you want to go to another copy?",
      "translation" : "[頻道傳送官員]\n依斯魯得很熱鬧，對吧？\n我在這裡幫大家分流，讓活動更順暢！\n我可以送您去另一個頻道的依斯魯得。\n您想換個頻道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "F_IzludeChannel",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Never mind",
      "translation" : "算了"
